{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"HANDOFF 2 (2026-11-16, session rebar-session-3d705fec).\n- aff9 sarcastic-specified-kodiakbear: CLOSED. Gerrit 3405 merged as 9099c548247.\n- S2 emblematic-mutinous-loris: CLOSED. Gerrit 3409 merged as 390f926c7ea.\n- NEW child silk-unpleasant-jackal (11aa-b3fb-f239-4f7a, discovered_from S3): S1 engine rewritten to stream one fast-import (get-mark SHAs mid-stream, diff-tree replay, cat-file --batch). Real-scale dry-run on a TMPDIR shadow of origin/tickets T0 85e68dbabe4: 13,149 commits replayed, 296,408 collapsed, 952.6 s, exit 0. Previous engine was infeasible (~2.9 billion subprocesses). in_progress; Gerrit 3410 (commit 0f980b65fa039c46462d563662340e1cda935034), make verify green, awaiting votes. Next: submit with scripts/gerrit_safe_submit.py 3410 --revision 0f980b65fa039c46462d563662340e1cda935034, tick ACs (no text changes), verify_completion_start, close.\n- 51a7 mystical-capsizable-ibis: description rewritten (sweep_retired option on the collapse, C1/C2/C4/C5 drop set, CREATE tombstones kept), now depends_on silk-unpleasant-jackal. Not reviewed or claimed.\n- 8dc4 democratic-untiring-saiga: description rewritten (reclaim_dry_run harness: clone, fake file:// remote, collapse, stamp, publish, reducer equality, verify-identity, blobless pack before/after, evidence.json; non-codebase AC is one real-data run plus human go/no-go). Now depends_on silk-unpleasant-jackal. Not reviewed or claimed.\n- Lesson for closes: tick AC boxes only; any text edit (even evidence lines) makes the plan stale-material and forces a fresh review-plan. Provenance format must be environment=…; principal=…; privilege_posture=<production-equivalent|broader|narrower>; instrument=<live-call|simulation|static-analysis> — justification.\n- No live tickets store or origin/tickets was rewritten, reset, swapped or force-pushed. The real-scale probe ran in a TMPDIR clone with no remote and was dry-run only."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1794881827333588803,"uuid":"c1875e20-cc3b-4f3a-8475-07fd1b2112aa"}